        "branch_phase": null,
        "authored_group": "MSQID_Comp_BattleTower"
      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "奪い返してくれたこと、礼を言うよ。\n奴らは、何故、星を怖がるのだろうな？\n夜空の闇の向こうに、何か恐ろしいものでも\n潜んでいるとでも言うのだろうか……？",
        "official_en": "Thank you for retrieving my records. Why are they\nso afraid of the stars, do you suppose? Perhaps they\nfear something terrifying lurks beyond the veil of the\nnight sky.",
        "real_en": null
      },
